Graded: a README for the graded Forecast pages, editable like a document

One README shared by Forecasting, Recording, Purchases and History (graded side): a README button beside the chips opens
a resizable editor with a toolbar (bold, italic, underline, smaller / bigger, heading, lists, clear) and the Docs
shortcuts (⌘B ⌘I ⌘U, ⌘⇧. / ⌘⇧, for size, ⌘S to save). Saved through the collector (help key r:fcg, now allowed), so
every device shows it; unsaved typing stays in the browser as a draft.

